{"v":1,"id":"909e94b05bb1","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"You think the fight is in desires,","s":0.8,"e":6.94},{"t":"in the pull you feel inside…","s":7.02,"e":12.59},{"t":"but the real temptation whispers","s":12.65,"e":18.11},{"t":"you should handle this alone tonight.","s":18.19,"e":24.36},{"t":"Independence is labeled strength,","s":24.39,"e":28.96},{"t":"you call on courage to endure,","s":29.04,"e":34.53},{"t":"but I never asked you to be fearless...","s":34.59,"e":40.93},{"t":"only close, only secure.","s":41.01,"e":46.33},{"t":"Every intent that makes for distance,","s":46.36,"e":52.22},{"t":"every time you brace for space,","s":52.26,"e":57.61},{"t":"Each transgression simply highlights","s":57.69,"e":63.61},{"t":"you’ve forgotten My embrace.","s":63.71,"e":68.31},{"t":"Stay with Me.","s":68.36,"e":72.78},{"t":"That’s what obedience has been.","s":72.8,"e":78.43},{"t":"Not proving you’re enough,","s":78.51,"e":80.51},{"t":"just locking in.","s":80.59,"e":84.47},{"t":"Every trial is a chance","s":84.52,"e":86.65},{"t":"to stop, and look to Me.","s":86.77,"e":88.82},{"t":"Don’t fight alone.","s":88.84,"e":90.11},{"t":"No! Stay with Me.","s":90.21,"e":95.16},{"t":"I see the moment pressure rises,","s":95.18,"e":101.2},{"t":"when the old resolve kicks in…","s":101.23,"e":106.28},{"t":"you start assembling your answers,","s":106.36,"e":112.19},{"t":"trying not to need Me then.","s":112.28,"e":116.73},{"t":"But child, the way through every trial","s":116.81,"e":120.0},{"t":"is never you alone, outpacing fear...","s":120.12,"e":129.19},{"t":"It was always us together,","s":129.22,"e":134.49},{"t":"step by step, right here.","s":134.54,"e":139.98},{"t":"What you call temptation’s voice","s":139.99,"e":145.85},{"t":"is calling for lonely strife.","s":145.97,"e":147.97},{"t":"But My Spirit quiet, in your heart...","s":148.01,"e":156.6},{"t":"Says “Let Me empower your life.”","s":156.65,"e":161.86},{"t":"Chorus]","s":161.9,"e":162.2},{"t":"Stay with Me.","s":162.24,"e":166.21},{"t":"That’s what obedience has been.","s":166.23,"e":171.86},{"t":"Not proving you’re enough,","s":171.94,"e":173.94},{"t":"just locking in.","s":174.02,"e":177.98},{"t":"Every trial is a chance","s":178.03,"e":180.08},{"t":"to stop, and look to Me.","s":180.2,"e":181.48},{"t":"Don’t fight alone.","s":181.52,"e":183.78},{"t":"No! Stay with Me.","s":183.88,"e":186.5},{"t":"The days ahead will test your footing,","s":186.51,"e":192.13},{"t":"not testing worth, nor what I see…","s":192.21,"e":197.61},{"t":"You won’t survive by standing stronger...","s":197.67,"e":202.78},{"t":"you’ll endure by leaning on Me.","s":202.79,"e":207.02},{"t":"When the weight feels impossible,","s":207.06,"e":210.08},{"t":"human wisdom runs thin and small,","s":210.16,"e":213.41},{"t":"Remember this before you wonder:","s":213.48,"e":218.5},{"t":"I have already carried it all.","s":218.62,"e":221.85},{"t":"Chorus]","s":221.93,"e":223.18},{"t":"Stay with Me.","s":223.28,"e":227.65},{"t":"That’s what obedience has been.","s":227.66,"e":233.3},{"t":"Not proving you’re enough,","s":233.38,"e":235.36},{"t":"just locking in.","s":235.42,"e":239.34},{"t":"Every trial is a chance","s":239.39,"e":241.6},{"t":"to stop, and look to Me.","s":241.68,"e":243.69},{"t":"Don’t fight alone.","s":243.71,"e":245.21},{"t":"No! Stay with Me.","s":245.32,"e":250.98},{"t":"This is how you’re kept.","s":251.0,"e":256.56},{"t":"This is how you stand.","s":256.61,"e":262.68},{"t":"Not alone. No!","s":262.78,"e":267.86},{"t":"Never alone.","s":267.95,"e":269.44}],"match":null}
